    {
      "text": "由 mHealth Alliance 和 Vital Wave Consulting 发布的报告《Sustainable Financing for Mobile Health (mHealth): Options and opportunities for mHealth financial models in low and middle-income countries》的封面，配有由多张人们使用移动设备的小照片组成的拼贴图。",
